    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT IS UAZO ?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Uazo, you play as a bird exploring procedurally-generated worlds filled with ancient ruins, magic artefacts and forgotten secrets. Play solo, or with your friends. Explore, gather resources, build nests and bird-houses, survive and uncover the story of this cloud shrouded island ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182050/extras/69715594728861bc9331fcc792a89ee9.poster.avif?t=1755092766\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182050/extras/69715594728861bc9331fcc792a89ee9.webm?t=1755092766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FLY FREELY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uazo lets you play as a bird with near infinite flight, but it doesn't mean you can fly recklessly ! Flapping your wings consumes stamina, consuming stamina makes your bird hungry, and if you're hungry, you can't fly for long. So glide to take a breath, dive and use magic ! Be efficient so you can fly as long as you want ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182050/extras/b3384976b5c6fcf60f80eeb31c5a807e.poster.avif?t=1755092766\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182050/extras/b3384976b5c6fcf60f80eeb31c5a807e.webm?t=1755092766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE STRANGE WORLDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a forgotten island surrounded by strange rotating ruins. Find traces of lost magic and open gates to other fantastic worlds. Search for clues from the sky and discover the history of the island. But beware, not everything is safe on this seemingly peaceful world !<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182050/extras/6a3ebf9725cf2f04c16d120355dbfbc5.poster.avif?t=1755092766\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182050/extras/6a3ebf9725cf2f04c16d120355dbfbc5.webm?t=1755092766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOURSELF A HOUSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the resources you find around the island to build a bird-house on a tree, and have a cozy refuge to rest after your explorations, or as an outpost in the far reaches of the world. Customize both the outside and the inside of your house with  a comfy nest, flowers, pillows and more !  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182050/extras/b9ff36dca9fc9ef387010c2c85b64982.poster.avif?t=1755092766\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182050/extras/b9ff36dca9fc9ef387010c2c85b64982.webm?t=1755092766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT ITEMS TO HELP IN YOUR JOURNEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources  can also be used to craft a variety of items ! Food, tools, gear, but also magic items that will allow you to unlock the secrets hidden all over the world. Make use of everything you can find on your journey across the island of Uazo ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182050/extras/14188b70ed0284b45697f44508dab0f5.poster.avif?t=1755092766\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182050/extras/14188b70ed0284b45697f44508dab0f5.webm?t=1755092766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY WITH YOUR FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't want to play alone ? Don't worry, your friends can join you on your adventure with online co-op ! Play the way you want, explore at your own pace, and spend time with your fellow birds in a shared a home  !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182050/extras/5d68e51cffd36ad5e0c84d709ba41e65.poster.avif?t=1755092766\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182050/extras/5d68e51cffd36ad5e0c84d709ba41e65.webm?t=1755092766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly : You're a bird, flap your wings and soar through the sky !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive : Fly down at high speeds and use the momentum to travel long distances !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore : Fly through large procedurally-generated worlds with peaceful views !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search : Look for clues on the ground from the sky to discover the secrets of the island !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft : Gather resources and craft items and equipment to help you on your journey !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build : Make yourself a home in the trees to rest after a long day !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm : Grow plants, catch fish and cook to keep your stomach full and your wings strong !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your bird ! Change the colors and shape of your feathers, or craft hats to wear !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer : Explore solo or with friends in online co-op !</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT IS UAZO ?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Uazo, you play as a bird exploring procedurally-generated worlds filled with ancient ruins, magic artefacts and forgotten secrets. Play solo, or with your friends. Explore, gather resources, build nests and bird-houses, survive and uncover the story of this cloud shrouded island ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182050/extras/69715594728861bc9331fcc792a89ee9.poster.avif?t=1755092766\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182050/extras/69715594728861bc9331fcc792a89ee9.webm?t=1755092766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FLY FREELY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uazo lets you play as a bird with near infinite flight, but it doesn't mean you can fly recklessly ! Flapping your wings consumes stamina, consuming stamina makes your bird hungry, and if you're hungry, you can't fly for long. So glide to take a breath, dive and use magic ! Be efficient so you can fly as long as you want ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182050/extras/b3384976b5c6fcf60f80eeb31c5a807e.poster.avif?t=1755092766\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182050/extras/b3384976b5c6fcf60f80eeb31c5a807e.webm?t=1755092766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE STRANGE WORLDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a forgotten 